{"id": "1545236131740651540", "channel_id": "1400750050208125010", "author_id": "870217954053193738", "author_name": "46982105", "content": "Three men in a gulag. One of them’s a new inmate, asks the first two: “Why did they send you here?”\nFirst man says: “They sent me here 10 years ago for criticising Comrade Popov.”\nSecond man says: “They sent me here 5 years ago for praising Comrade Popov. You?”\nThird man says: “I am Comrade Popov.”\nAfterwards, a fourth man arrives. He is in a state of great distress, sobbing and shaking so badly he can barely stand.\nThe three men attempt to comfort him: “Do not despair Comrade, it is not all bad. I heard the great clown Pagliacci will be performing for us tonight!”\nThe fourth man says: “But Comrade…”", "timestamp": "2026-09-04T00:56:42.906000+00:00"}
